The '''Iron Mace''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[sword]].

Apart from the [[Area of Effect|AoE]] slam on the final m1, the sword lacks much use or utility.

==Obtainment==
The Iron Mace can be purchased for {{Money|25,000}} from the [[Sword Dealer of the West]], who is located at the [[Pirate Village]] found in the [[First Sea]].

